# MASTER PROMPT: BUILD "LICENCE HOLDING" — INDIA'S ALL-IN-ONE LICENCE INFORMATION PLATFORM

## 1. YOUR ROLE

Act as a senior full-stack developer, UI/UX designer, AI engineer, product architect, and Indian government digital-services research specialist.

Build a production-oriented, responsive, AI-powered web application called **Licence Holding**.

The application should help individuals, entrepreneurs, shop owners, professionals, farmers, drivers, food businesses, and companies in India discover, understand, prepare for, and apply for different types of licences and registrations through one unified platform.

The primary goal is to eliminate the confusion of searching multiple websites to understand licence requirements, eligibility, documents, application procedures, government fees, renewals, and official application portals.

Do not create only a landing page, static prototype, or visual mockup. Build a functional application with working navigation, search, category pages, licence details, AI assistance, filters, application checklists, and reliable data architecture.

When an external government service cannot be integrated directly, guide users to its official portal instead of pretending that an application has been submitted.

